  "notes": [
    "The 2.7a archive supplies all four 68k executables. The default FileX is byte-identical to the 68020 variant. The binaries identify as 2.7 (12.06.2014).",
    "Checked BCWB inputs supply all twelve installed icons. The archive supplies the documentation, catalogs and ARexx examples.",
    "The stock installation has no FileX ENVARC settings. The separately queued reqtools.library stays outside this package."
